<title>USA: Vestro to change name, symbol.</title>
<headline>Vestro to change name, symbol.</headline>
<dateline>CARSON, Calif. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vestro Natural Foods Inc said Tuesday its shareholders voted to change the company's name to Westbrae Natural Inc, and to change the Nasdaq trading symbol to WNAT.O.</p>
<p>The change, adopted to identify the company with its Westbrae and WestSoy brands, will become effective July 7.</p>
